#. Tag: title
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toolbars"
msgstr "របារ​ឧបករណ៍​"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section describes &krita;'s toolbars. By default, the <guilabel>Krita</"
"guilabel> toolbar is located to the left of the drawing area, while the "
"others can be found at the top, below the menu bar."
msgstr ""
"ភាគ​នេះ​ពិពណ៌នា​អំពី​របារឧបករណ៍​របស់ &krita; ។ តាម​លំនាំដើម​របារឧបករណ៍​<guilabel>Krita</"
"guilabel> មាន​ទីតាំងនៅ​ខាង​ឆ្វេង​ផ្ទៃ​ដែល​ត្រូវ​គូរ ហើយ​របារឧបករណ៍​ផ្សេង​ទៀត​អាច​រក​ឃើញ​នៅ​កំពូល​ខាង​ក្រោម​"
"របារម៉ឺនុយ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can customize your toolbars by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or by "
"clicking with the &RMB; on a toolbar and choosing <guimenuitem>Configure "
"Toolbars...</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ប្ដូរ​របារឧបករណ៍​របស់​អ្នក​តាម​បំណង​ដោយជ្រើស​<menuchoice><guimenu>ការ​កំណត់​</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>កំណត់​រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​របារឧបករណ៍...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ឬ​ចុច​"
"កណ្តុរ​ស្តាំ​លើ​របារឧបករណ៍​ ហើយ​ជ្រើស​<guimenuitem>កំណត់​រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​របារឧបករណ៍...</"
"guimenuitem> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>File</guilabel> Toolbar"
msgstr "របារឧបករណ៍​ <guilabel>ឯកសារ​</guilabel>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>File</guilabel> toolbar</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>របារ​ឧបករណ៍ <guilabel>ឯកសារ​</guilabel> </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>File</guilabel> toolbar</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>របារឧបករណ៍​<guilabel>ឯកសារ​</guilabel></phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>File</guilabel> toolbar</para>"
msgstr "<para>របារ​ឧបករណ៍​<guilabel></guilabel> </para>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This toolbar contains actions for working with files. In &krita;'s default, "
"there are five buttons on this toolbar: <guilabel>New</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Open</guilabel>, <guilabel>Save</guilabel>, <guilabel>Print "
"Preview</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Print</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"របារឧបករណ៍​នេះ​មានអំពើ​ច្រើន​សម្រាប់​ធ្វើ​ការជាមួយ​ឯកសារ ។ តាម​លំនាំដើម​របស់ &krita; នៅ​លើ​"
"របារឧបករណ៍​នេះ​មាន​ប៊ូតុង​ចំនួន​ប្រាំ ៖ <guilabel>ថ្មី</guilabel> <guilabel>បើក​</guilabel> "
"<guilabel>រក្សាទុក​</guilabel> <guilabel>មើល​មុន​បោះពុម្ព</guilabel>និង​ "
"<guilabel>បោះពុម្ព</guilabel> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These actions all correspond to entries in the <link linkend=\"commands-"
"menus-file\"><guimenu>File</guimenu> menu</link>."
msgstr ""
"អំពើ​ទាំងនេះ​ឆ្លើយតប​ទៅ​ធាតុ​នៅ​ក្នុង​ <link linkend=\"commands-menus-file"
"\"><guimenu>ឯកសារ</guimenu> ម៉ឺនុយ</link> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> Toolbar"
msgstr "របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel>កែសម្រួល​</guilabel> "

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> toolbar</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>របារឧបករណ៍ <guilabel>កែសម្រួល​</guilabel> </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> toolbar</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>របារឧបករណ៍​<guilabel>កែសម្រួល</guilabel></phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Edit</guilabel> toolbar</para>"
msgstr "<para>របារឧបករណ៍​<guilabel>កែសម្រួល</guilabel> </para>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This toolbar contains editing actions. With default settings this toolbar "
"offers four buttons: <guilabel>Undo</guilabel>, <guilabel>Redo</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Cut</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Copy</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"របារឧបករណ៍​នេះ​មាន​អំពើ​កែសម្រួល ។ តាម​ការកំណត់​លំនាំដើម​របារឧបករណ៍នេះ​ផ្តល់​នូវ​ប៊ូតុង​ចំនួន​ប្រាំ ៖ "
"<guilabel>មិន​ធ្វើវិញ</guilabel> <guilabel>ធ្វើ​វិញ</guilabel> <guilabel>កាត់</"
"guilabel>និង​<guilabel>ចម្លង​</guilabel> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These actions all correspond to entries in the <link linkend=\"commands-"
"menus-edit\"><guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu</link>."
msgstr ""
"អំពើ​ទាំងនេះត្រូវ​គ្នា​នឹង​ធាតុ​នៅក្នុង<link linkend=\"commands-menus-edit\"><guimenu>ម៉ឺនុយ</"
"guimenu> កែសម្រួល</link> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Navigation</guilabel> Toolbar"
msgstr "របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> ការ​រុករក</guilabel>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Navigation</guilabel> toolbar</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> ការ​រុករក</guilabel></screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Navigation</guilabel> toolbar</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> ការ​រុករក</guilabel></phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Navigation</guilabel> toolbar</para>"
msgstr "<para>របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> ការ​រុករក</guilabel></para>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This toolbar offers easy access to navigation actions. The two default "
"actions available are <guilabel>Zoom In</guilabel> and <guilabel>Zoom Out</"
"guilabel>. With <guilabel>Zoom In</guilabel>, the zoom level is increased. "
"You will see less, but in higher detail. With <guilabel>Zoom Out</guilabel>, "
"the zoom level is decreased, so that you see more at less detail."
msgstr ""
"របារឧបករណ៍​នេះ​ផ្តល់​នូវ​ភាពងាយស្រួល​ចូលដំណើរការ​ទៅ​កាន់​ការរុករក​អំពើ ។ អំពើ​លំនាំដើម​ចំនួន​ពីរ​អាច​រក​បានគឺ "
"<guilabel>ពង្រី</guilabel>និង <guilabel>បង្រួម</guilabel> ។ ជាមួយ <guilabel>ពង្រីក​</"
"guilabel> បង្កើន​កម្រិត​ពង្រីក ។ អ្នកនឹង​អាច​មើល​បាន​តិច ប៉ុន្តែ​មើល​ក្នុង ​កម្រិត​ខ្ពស់ ។ "
"<guilabel>បង្រួម​</guilabel>បន្ថយ​កម្រិត​ពង្រីក​ ដូច្នេះ​អ្នក​អាច​មើល​បាន​ច្រើន​ ប៉ុន្តែ​វា​មិន​លម្អិត​ទេ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Krita</guilabel> Toolbar"
msgstr "របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> Krita</guilabel>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Krita</guilabel> toolbar</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> Krita</guilabel></screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Krita</guilabel> toolbar</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> Krita</guilabel></phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Krita</guilabel> toolbar</para>"
msgstr "<para>របារឧបករណ៍<guilabel> Krita</guilabel></para>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This toolbar contains painting operations and tools, as well as editing and "
"selecting tools. The available actions and some controls are listed below. "
"You can change the behaviour of most tools (and with that, usually the "
"resulting effect) by setting their <link linkend=\"commands-palettes-"
"controlbox-tool\">options</link>."
msgstr ""
"របារឧបករណ៍​នេះ​មាន​ការប្រតិបត្តិការគូរ​ និង​ឧបករណ៍​ជាច្រើន​ក៏​ដូច​ជា​ការកែសម្រួល និង​ឧបករណ៍ ជ្រើស​"
"ផងដែរ ។ អំពើ​ និង​វត្ថុបញ្ជា​មួយ​ចំនួន​អាច​រក​បាន​នៅ​ក្នុង​បញ្ជី​ខាងក្រោម​នេះ ។ អ្នកអាច​ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ ​លក្ខណៈនៃ​"
"ឧបករណ៍​ទាំងនោះ (មាន​ឥទ្ធិពល​ជាលទ្ធផល​) តាម​ការកំនត់​<link linkend=\"commands-palettes-"
"controlbox-tool\">ជ្រើស​របស់​ពួក​វា</link> ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brush"
msgstr "ជក់"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this tool you can paint freely. Click the &LMB; to paint a single "
"instance of the currently selected brush, or hold the &LMB; and drag your "
"mouse around to paint. The mouse movements you make are directly used for "
"painting."
msgstr ""
"ជាមួយ​ឧបករណ៍​នេះ​អ្នកអាច​គូរ​បាន​ដោយ​ស៊េរី ។ ចុច​កណ្តុរឆ្វេង​ដើម្បី​គូរ​វត្ថុមួយ​នៃ​ជក់​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស ​បច្ចុប្បន្ន ឬ​"
"ចុច​កណ្តុរ​ឆ្វេង​ ហើយ​ទម្លាក់​កណ្តុរ​របស់​អ្នក​ដើម្បី​គូរ ។.ការ​ផ្លាស់ទី​កណ្តុរ​អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់គូរ​ដោយ​ផ្ទាល់ ។."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line"
msgstr "បន្ទាត់"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tool is used to draw lines. Click the &LMB; to indicate the first "
"endpoint, keep the button pressed, drag to the second endpoint and release "
"the button."
msgstr ""
"ឧបករណ៍​នេះ​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់​គូរ​បន្ទាត់ ។ ចុច​កណ្តុរ​ឆ្វេង​ចុង​ចំណុច​ដំបូង​ នៅ​តែ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង​ឆ្វេង​ដដែល​ហើយ​អូសទៅ​ចុង​"
"ចំណុចទីពីរ​ បន្ទាប់​មក​លេង​ប៊ូតុង​នោះ​ភ្លាម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use &Shift; while holding the mouse button to restrict drawing to only "
"horizontal or vertical lines. You can press &Alt; while still keeping the "
"&LMB; down to move the line to a different location."
msgstr ""
"ប្រើ​គ្រាប់ចុច​ប្ដូរ (&Shift;) ខណៈពេល​កំពុង​ចុច​កណ្តុរ​ដើម្បី​កំណត់​ការគូរ​តែ​បន្ទាប់​ផ្តេក ឬ​បញ្ឈរ ។ អ្នកអាច​"
"ចុច​ឆ្លាស់ (&Alt;) ពេល​អ្នកនៅ​តែ​ចុច​កណ្តុរ​ឆ្វេង​ដើម្បី​ផ្លាស់ទី​បន្ទាត់​ទៅ​ទីតាំង​ខុសៗគ្នា ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "ចតុកោណកែង"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tool can be used to paint rectangles. Click and hold the &LMB; to "
"indicate one corner of the rectangle, drag to the opposite corner, and "
"release the button."
msgstr ""
"ឧបករណ៍​នេះ​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់​គូរ​ចតុកោណកែង ។ ចុច​កណ្តុរ​ឆ្វេង​ដើម្បីបង្ហាញ​ជ្រុង​ចតុកោណកែង​ អូសទៅ ​ជ្រុង​​ម្ខាង​ទៀត "
"ហើយ​លេង​ប៊ូតុង ។"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:153
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you hold &Shift; while drawing, a square will be drawn instead of a "
"rectangle. Holding &Ctrl; will change the way the rectangle is constructed. "
"Normally, the first mouse click indicates one corner and the second click "
"the opposite. With &Ctrl;, the initial mouse position indicates the center "
"of the rectangle, and the final mouse position indicates a corner. You can "
"press &Alt; while still keeping the &LMB; down to move the rectangle to a "
"different location."
msgstr ""
"បើអ្នក​ចុច​គ្រាប់ចុច​ប្ដូរ (&Shift;) ពេល​កំពុង​គូ​ វា​នឹង​គូរ​ជារាងការ៉េ​វិញ​ម្តង ។ចុច​គ្រាប់ចុច​បញ្ជា "
"(&Ctrl;) វា​នឹង​បង្កើត​ជា​ចតុកោណកែង ។ជាធម្មតា ចុចកណ្តុរ​ដំបូង​គេ​វា​បង្កើត​ជ្រុង​មួយ ហើយ​ចុច​លើក​ទីពីរ​វា​"
"បង្កើត​ជ្រុង​ផ្ទុយ​ពី​មុន ។ចុច​គ្រាប់ចុចបញ្ជា (&Ctrl;) ទីតាំង​ចាប់​ផ្តើម​កណ្តុរ​បង្កើត​បាន​ជា​ចំណុច​កណ្តាល​របស់​"
"ចតុកោណ កែង ហើយ​ទីតាំង​ចុងក្រោយ​បង្កើត​បាន​ជ្រុង ។ អ្នកអាច​ចុច​​គ្រាប់ចុច​ឆ្លាស់ (&Alt;)​ហើយ​នៅ​តែ​ចុច​កណ្តុរ​"
"ឆ្វេង​ចុះក្រោម​ដើម្បី​ផ្លាស់ទី​ចតុកោណកែង​ទៅ​ទីតាំង​ខុស​គ្នា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change between the corner/corner and center/corner drawing methods "
"as often as you want by pressing or releasing &Ctrl;, provided that you keep "
"the &LMB; pressed. With &Ctrl; pressed, mouse movements will affect all four "
"corners of the rectangle (relative to the center), without &Ctrl;, one of "
"the corners is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"អ្នកអាច​ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​រវាង​វិធីសាស្ត្រ​ការគូរ​ជ្រុងង​/ជ្រុង និង​ចំណុច​កណ្តាល​/ជ្រុង ដរាប​ណា​អ្នក​ចង់ចុច ឬ​លេង ​បញ្ជា "
"( &Ctrl),ហើយ​អ្នក​នៅ​តែ​រក្សាកណ្តុរ​ឆ្វេង​ដដែល ។.ចុច​គ្រាប់ចុច​បញ្ជា ( &Ctrl),ផ្លាស់ទី​កណ្តុរ​ វា​នឹងមាន​"
"ប្រសិទ្ធភាព​គ្រប់​ជ្រុង​ទាំងបួន​របស់​ចតុកោណកែង ។e ទាក់ទង​ចំណុច​កណ្តាលr,បើ​មិនចុច​គ្រាប់​ចុច​បញ្ជា ( &Ctrl),"
"ជ្រុង​ត្រូវទាំងនោះ​គ្មាន​មាាន​ប្រសិទ្ធភាព​ឡើយ ។."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "ពង​ក្រពើ"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this tool to paint an ellipse. The currently selected brush is used for "
"drawing the ellipse outline. Click and hold the &LMB; to indicate one corner "
"of the <quote>bounding rectangle</quote> of the ellipse, then move your "
"mouse to the opposite corner. &krita; will show a preview of the ellipse "
"using a thin line. Release the button to draw the ellipse."
msgstr ""
"ប្រើ​ឧបករណ៍​នេះ​ដើម្បី​គូរ​រាង​ពងក្រពើ ។ ជក់​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់​គូរ​គ្រោង​រាងពងក្រពើ ។ ចុច​​"
"កណ្តុរ​ឆ្វេង​ដើម្បី​បង្ហាញ​ជ្រុង​ <quote>ព្រំដែន​ចតុកោណកែង​</quote>នៃ​រាង​ពងប្រពើ បន្ទាប់​មក​ផ្លាស់ទី​កណ្តុរ​"
"ទៅ​ជ្រុង​ផ្ទុយ​គ្នា ។&krita; នឹង​បង្ហាញ​ជាមុន​នូវ​រាង​ពងក្រពើ​ដោយ​ប្រើ​បន្ទាត់​ស្តើង​ ។ លេង​ប៊ូតុង​គូរ​រាង​ពង​"
"ក្រពើ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:178
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you hold &Shift; while drawing, a circle will be drawn instead of an "
"ellipse. Holding &Ctrl; will change the way the ellipse is constructed: "
"instead of two corners, the initial mouse position indicates the ellipse "
"center, and the final mouse position indicates one of the corners of the "
"bounding rectangle. You can press &Alt; while still keeping the &LMB; down "
"to move the ellipse to a different location."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នកចុច​គ្រាប់ចុច​ (&Shift;) ខណៈ​ពេល​គូរ​រង្វង់​ជំនួស​រាង​ពងក្រពើ ។ចុច​គ្រាប់ចុច​បញ្ជា (&Ctrl;) វា​នឹង​"
"ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ទៅ​ជារាង​ពងក្រពើ​វិញ ៖ instead of two corners, the initial mouse position "
"indicates the ellipse center, and the final mouse position indicates one of "
"the corners of the bounding rectangle. You can press &Alt; while still "
"keeping the &LMB; down to move the ellipse to a different location."

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:185
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change between the corner/corner and center/corner drawing methods "
"as often as you want by pressing or releasing &Ctrl;, provided that you keep "
"the &LMB; pressed. With &Ctrl; pressed, mouse movements will affect all four "
"corners of the bounding rectangle (relative to the center), without &Ctrl;, "
"the corner opposite to the one you are moving remains still."
msgstr "អ្នក នៅ​ចន្លោះ និង ឬ&Ctrl;&LMB; មាន​&Ctrl; កណ្ដុរ ទាំងអស់ ដល់&Ctrl; ដល់ មួយ."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Polygon"
msgstr "ពហុកោណ"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:196
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this tool you can draw polygons. Click the &LMB; to indicate the "
"starting point and successive vertices, then double-click or press &Enter; "
"to connect the last vertex to the starting point."
msgstr "មាន​ ចុច&LMB; ដល់ ចំណុច និង ឬ&Enter; ដល់ ដល់ ចំណុច."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid "Polyline"
msgstr "ពហុ​បន្ទាត់​"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:205
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Polylines are drawn like polygons, with the difference that the double-click "
"indicating the end of the polyline does not connect the last vertex to the "
"first one."
msgstr "ដោយ ដល់ ទី​មួយ មួយ."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid "Star"
msgstr "ផ្កាយ​"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:214
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tool creates star-shaped objects. Press the &LMB; to indicate the "
"center, and drag the mouse to change the size and rotation of the star."
msgstr "&LMB; ដល់ និង កណ្ដុរ ដល់ ទំហំ និង."

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:217
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can press &Alt; while still keeping the &LMB; down to move the star to a "
"different location."
msgstr "អ្នក&Alt;&LMB; ដល់ ដល់ a."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bezier"
msgstr "Bezier"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:225
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can draw Bezier curves by using this tool. Click the &LMB; to indicate "
"the starting point of the curve, then click again for consecutive control "
"points of the curve."
msgstr "អ្នក ចុច&LMB; ដល់ ចំណុច ខ្សែកោង​ សម្រាប់ ខ្សែកោង​."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:232
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Drawing a Bezier curve</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> a ខ្សែកោង​</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:238
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Drawing a Bezier curve</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> a ខ្សែកោង​</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:240
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Drawing a Bezier curve</para>"
msgstr "<para> a ខ្សែកោង​</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:244
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krita; will show a blue line with two handles when you add a control point. "
"You can drag these handles to change the direction of the curve in that "
"point."
msgstr "&krita; a ខៀវ បន្ទាត់​ ដោយ ពីរ a ចំណុច អ្នក ដល់ ខ្សែកោង​ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ចំណុច."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:250
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Modifying a Bezier curve</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> a ខ្សែកោង​</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:256
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Modifying a Bezier curve</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> a ខ្សែកោង​</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:258
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Modifying a Bezier curve</para>"
msgstr "<para> a ខ្សែកោង​</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:262
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can click on a previously inserted control point to modify it. With an "
"intermediate control point (&ie; a point that is not the starting point and "
"not the ending point), you can move the direction handles separately to have "
"the curve enter and leave the point in different directions. After editing a "
"point, you can just click on the canvas to continue adding points to the "
"curve."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក a ចំណុច ដល់ មាន​ ចំណុច&ie; a ចំណុច ជា ចំណុច និង ចំណុច ដល់ ខ្សែកោង​ និង ចំណុច អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ បន្ទាប់ពី a "
"ចំណុច ដល់ ដល់ ខ្សែកោង​."

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:269
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing <keycap>Delete</keycap> will remove the currently selected control "
"point from the curve. Double-click the &LMB; on any point of the curve or "
"press &Enter; to finish drawing, or press &Esc; to cancel the entire curve. "
"You can use &Ctrl; while keeping the &LMB; pressed to move the entire curve "
"to a different position."
msgstr ""
"<keycap> លុប</keycap> ចំណុច ពី ខ្សែកោង​ ទ្វេ​ដង&LMB; ចំណុច ខ្សែកោង​ ឬ&Enter; ដល់ ឬ&Esc; "
"ដល់ ខ្សែកោង​ អ្នក&Ctrl;&LMB; ដល់ ខ្សែកោង​ ដល់ a."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:278
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>A finished Bezier curve</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> A ខ្សែកោង​</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:284
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>A finished Bezier curve</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> A ខ្សែកោង​</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:286
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<para>A finished Bezier curve</para>"
msgstr "<para> A ខ្សែកោង​</para>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:293
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "ច្បាប់​ចម្លង"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:294
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use this tool to duplicate parts of an image. Press &Shift; and "
"click with the &LMB; on the location you want to duplicate from. &krita; "
"will indicate this location by an outline of your current brush. Then click "
"with the &LMB; to designate the location where you want to duplicate to, and "
"drag with the mouse. You will then duplicate whatever is at the source "
"location to the current (destination) location."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក ដល់ ស្ទួន រូបភាព&Shift; និង ដោយ&LMB; ដល់ ស្ទួន ពី&krita; ដោយ&LMB; ដល់ ដល់ ស្ទួន ដល់ និង "
"ដោយ កណ្ដុរ អ្នក ស្ទួន ជា នៅ ប្រភព ដល់."

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:301
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While you are painting the duplicate, both your cursor in the destination "
"location and the brush outline in the source location will move, in order to "
"give you visual feedback."
msgstr "ការ​គូរ ស្ទួន ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ និង អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ប្រភព អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ ដល់."

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:305
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also use this tool to correct colors in a part of the image: use the "
"<guilabel>Healing</guilabel> option for that."
msgstr "អ្នក ដល់ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍ a part រូបភាព<guilabel> ការ​សម្រួល</guilabel> សម្រាប់."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:312
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Paint with filters"
msgstr "គូរ​ដោយប្រើ​តម្រង"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:314
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tool allows you to pick a filter and draw with it. The image below "
"shows the effect of using a large circular brush and painting with, from "
"left to right, the Maximize Channel, Minimize Channel, Invert, and "
"Desaturate filters."
msgstr ""
"ដល់ a និង ដោយ រូបភាព a និង ការ​គូរ ដោយ ពី ដល់ ពង្រីក​អតិបរមា ប៉ុស្តិ៍ បង្រួម​អប្បបរមា ប៉ុស្តិ៍ បញ្ច្រាស "
"និង មិន​ជោគជាំ."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:321
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Painting with filters</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> ដោយ</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:327
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Painting with filters</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> ដោយ</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:329
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Painting with filters</para>"
msgstr "<para> ដោយ</para>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:336
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Crop"
msgstr "​ច្រឹប"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:337
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this tool you can crop a layer or an image to a certain rectangular "
"area. Click and drag with the &LMB; to define an area. This area is "
"designated by an outline with 8 handles. You can then use the handles to "
"change the size of the area which the image or layer is to be cropped to. "
"You can also click and drag inside the area to move the outline in its "
"entirety."
msgstr ""
"មាន​ a ឬ រូបភាព ដល់ a ចុច និង ដោយ&LMB; ដល់ ជា ដោយ អ្នក ដល់ ទំហំ រូបភាព ឬ ជា ដល់ ដល់ អ្នក "
"និង ដល់ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍."

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:343
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Double-click outside the area (i.e. on a part of the image that is to be "
"removed) to confirm the cropping operation."
msgstr "ទ្វេ​ដង i e a part រូបភាព ជា ដល់ ដល់."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:350
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Move"
msgstr "ផ្លាស់ទី"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:351
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this tool, you can move the current layer or selection by dragging the "
"mouse."
msgstr "មាន​ ឬ កណ្ដុរ."

#. Tag: term
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:358
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Transform"
msgstr "ប្លែង​"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:359
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With this tool you can quickly transform the current selection or layer. "
"Handles will appear at the corners and sides, with which you can resize the "
"selection or layer. You can perform rotations by moving the mouse above or "
"to the left of the handles and dragging it. You can also click anywhere "
"inside the selection or layer and move it by dragging the mouse."
msgstr "មាន​ ឬ នៅ និង ដោយ ឬ អ្នក កណ្ដុរ ឬ ដល់ និង អ្នក ឬ និង កណ្ដុរ."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:369
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Perspective Transform"
msgstr "ការ​ប្លែង​យថាទស្សន៍"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:370
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tool allows you to change the perspective of an image. Designate the "
"area which should become the new image by clicking at its top-left, top-"
"right, bottom-right and bottom-left corners. The area given by these four "
"corners will then be transformed so that the given corners become the "
"corners of the actual image."
msgstr "ដល់ រូបភាព រូបភាព នៅ និង រូបភាព."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:380
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Contiguous Fill"
msgstr "បំពេញ​ដែល​ជាប់គ្នា​"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-toolbars.docbook:381
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
